The triage now supports a Track B family, not Track A. The paper’s Theorem 2 supplies the matching reduction and certificate map, while the generated regular graph has a deliberately marked affine consistency structure: a standard connected-components pass over roughly \(n^2p\) marked exclusions recovers the matching mechanically, but a three-cycle invariant plus one anchor row compresses that to under 300 field operations. I’m implementing that honest algorithm/shortcut split and will reject it if either the cheap attacks or the hinted oracle can solve the shipping preset.
