closed (because otherwise $r^*$ together with the at least $\binom{k}{2}$ 
residents $r_e^*$ such that $h_e$ is closed form a blocking coalition to open 
$h^*$). For each of the $\binom{k}{2}$ color combinations $c< d\in [k]$,
